{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56357","headline":"恺悌诗（幷序） 宜兮一章（二十句）（宜兮，洽民心也。） · 孙宗闵","name":"恺悌诗（幷序） 宜兮一章（二十句）（宜兮，洽民心也。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"启藩斯境，民之宜兮。\n令必响赴，动而悦随。\n濬明宣哲，淑慎经彝。\n善化郁郁，羣心披披。\n我有惸独，公则安之，我有弟子，公则教之。\n匪民之宜，实德之基，实邦之基。\n帝典昭灼，王度清夷。\n说命将举，慰兹羣黎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙宗闵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56357.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56357","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}